[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0010","text":"阳希酱，你在做什么呀？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0020","text":"白三叶草戒指……\n小时候经常玩这个呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0030","text":"这样啊——\n是要送给谁的礼物吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0040","text":"嗯——只是想做做看而已\n也不是要送给谁……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0050","text":"────────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0060","text":"那就戴在路加酱的手指上试试吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0070","text":"诶！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0080","text":"────────………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0090","text":"这是什么……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800500_03_0100","text":"……………………草？"}]
